            "content": "---\nname: repo MCP uses URIs not paths\ndescription: When calling repo MCP tools, all identifying arguments must use MCP resource URIs, not file paths\ntype: feedback\n---\n\nAlways use MCP resource URIs (not file paths) for identifying arguments in repo MCP tools like `ticket_reopen`, `ticket_close`, `ticket_open`, etc.\n\n**Why:** MCP tools are resource-oriented; passing raw paths instead of URIs causes incorrect behavior or failures.\n\n**How to apply:** Whenever calling repo MCP tools that reference tickets, goals, drafts, or other resources, use the URI format returned by MCP (e.g., from `search` results or `ticket_open` response) — never construct a raw path string.\n"
